# Project Structure

Standalone Vite + React 18 dice game. No backend, no auth, no Base44.

| Area | Location |
|------|----------|
| Game logic | `src/lib/gameLogic.js`, `scoring.js`, `powers.js` |
| Local save (coins, XP, skins) | `src/lib/localProfile.js`, `src/hooks/useCosmetics.js` |
| Shop catalog | `src/lib/shopCatalog.js`, `progression.js`, `mysteryBoxes.js` |
| Pages | `src/pages/` |
| UI components | `src/components/` |
| Static assets | `public/assets/` |
| iOS wrapper | `ios/` (Capacitor) |

Stack: React Router, TanStack Query, Tailwind, Radix UI, Framer Motion, Three.js (3D dice).

Run: `npm run dev` · Build: `npm run build` · iOS: `npm run ios:sync && npm run ios:open`
